  {
    title: "Primary scope",
    body: "Kadence focuses on hybrid workplace management, office attendance coordination, workplace analytics, and space utilization. Skedular combines workplace booking, coworking operations, subscriptions, billing, invoicing, marketplace publishing, workspace discovery, and workspace commerce.",
  },
  {
    title: "Workplace analytics",
    body: "Workplace analytics, workplace visibility, office occupancy reporting, and space utilization insights are among Kadence's strongest capabilities.",
  },
  {
    title: "Coworking operations",
    body: "Skedular supports memberships, subscriptions, billing, invoicing, products, and operator workflows. Kadence is not positioned as a coworking operations platform.",
  },
  {
    title: "Marketplace and discovery",
    body: "Kadence is not positioned as a workspace marketplace or public workspace discovery network. Skedular includes marketplace publishing, public workspace discovery, and workspace commerce workflows.",
